    "summary": "Use it in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase). Pick 1 **SYNAPSE** unit of yours not yet picked to shoot or fight in this phase, and 1 enemy unit **visible** to it and within 24\" of it.\n\nFor the rest of the phase, if a friendly **TYRANIDS** model attacks that enemy unit and the attacker's unit is no more than 6\" from your **SYNAPSE** unit, Hit and **Wound rolls** of 1 for that attack may be re-rolled.",
